// # ooswarm package
//
// Logline: Canonical catalog package anchor for ooswarm (layers/L7-agents).
//
// Setup: Folder shape is manifest plus payload (ooswarm.oo).
//
// Beats:
//   1. manifest — name, version, caps, sha256 of ooswarm.oo.
